      <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Last Edit: 1/8/25&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;


&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;10.1 Parametric Equations 
    &lt;div id=&#34;101-parametric-equations&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#101-parametric-equations&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If x and y are continuous functions of t on an interval I, then the equations are called parametric equations and t is called the parameter
$$x=x(t) andy=y(t)$$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Eliminating the Parameter 化简 
    &lt;div id=&#34;eliminating-the-parameter-%E5%8C%96%E7%AE%80&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#eliminating-the-parameter-%E5%8C%96%E7%AE%80&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;通过关系式直接得到x和y之间的函数&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;ex. 
    &lt;div id=&#34;ex&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#ex&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
$$x(t) = t^2 - 3, \quad y(t) = 2t + 1, \quad -2 \leq t \leq 3.$$&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;从第二个Equation中提出\(t = \frac{y - 1}{2}\)后带入
$$x = \left(\frac{y - 1}{2}\right)^2 - 3 \\ = \frac{y^2 - 2y + 1}{4} - 3 \\ = \frac{y^2 - 2y - 11}{4}$$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Use Trigonometrey to Eliminate Parameter 
    &lt;div id=&#34;use-trigonometrey-to-eliminate-parameter&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#use-trigonometrey-to-eliminate-parameter&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;通过一些等式建立x和y之间的关系&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;例如\(\cos^2x+\sin^2 x=1\)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h4 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;ex. 
    &lt;div id=&#34;ex-1&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#ex-1&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;有\(x = 3 \cos \theta \quad \text{and} \quad y = 4 \sin \theta, \quad 0 \leq \theta \leq 2\pi\)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;通过\(cos \theta=\frac{x}{3},sin\theta=\frac{y}{4}\)替换原式，便有\((\frac{x}{3})^2+(\frac{y}{4})^2=1\)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;10.2 Calculus of Parametric Curves 
    &lt;div id=&#34;102-calculus-of-parametric-curves&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#102-calculus-of-parametric-curves&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;


&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Derivatives of Parametric Equations 
    &lt;div id=&#34;derivatives-of-parametric-equations&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#derivatives-of-parametric-equations&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If a smooth curve C is given by the equations
$$x = f(t) \quad \text{and} \quad y = g(t)$$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;then the slope of C at (x, y)  is
$$\frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{\frac{dy}{dt}}{\frac{dx}{dt}}, \quad \frac{dx}{dt} \neq 0
$$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Arc Length of a Parametric Curve 
    &lt;div id=&#34;arc-length-of-a-parametric-curve&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34;
            style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#arc-length-of-a-parametric-curve&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;普通的Arc Length公式为\(\int^b_a\sqrt{1+[f&amp;rsquo;(x)]^2}dx\)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;将Parametric Curve的Derivative带入，得到
$$\int^b_a\sqrt{1+(\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt})^2}dx=\int^b_a\sqrt{\frac{(dx/dt)^2+(dy/dt)^2}{(dx/dt)^2}}\frac{dx}{dt}dt$$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;也就是
$$=\int^b_a\sqrt{(\frac{dx}{dt})^2+(\frac{dy}{dt})^2}dt=\int^b_a\sqrt{[f&#39;(x)]^2+[g&#39;(t)]^2}dt$$&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10.3 Polar Coordinates 极坐标&lt;/p&gt;</description>
